00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:48,980
Oh, absolutely.

11
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:53,620
You can't just point to a single pixel and say, hey, there is the exact truth.

12
00:00:53,620 --> 00:01:03,700
Right, and it turns out that terrifying lack of a clean binary x-ray is happening right now, at this very moment, in the documents that you read every single day.

13
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,940
Yeah, it really is.

14
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:14,940
If a trusted system verifies a fact, and then, you know, an AI rephrases it, or translates it, or summarizes it for you, does the truth actually survive that transformation?

15
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:17,180
That is the million-dollar question.

16
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,000
It really is.

