00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:40,560
Which is?

59
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:50,260
Well, treating these watermarks as evidence of the continued validity of the information inside the document is a massive structural category error.

60
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:51,380
A category error.

61
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:56,860
Okay, I want to really dig into the mechanics of that because it sounds counterintuitive at first.

