65
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:07,780
The lineage.

66
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:08,260
Exactly.

67
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:09,660
It means the pointer is intact.

68
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:15,720
But the paper is so explicit here, the persistence of a pointer cannot stand in for the validity of the claim it points to.

69
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:16,420
Okay, wait.

