00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,440
Explain that a bit more.

71
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:29,700
So, a C2PA credential or a robust nano publication, all it really proves is that the digital artifact you are looking at traces its ancestry back to an earlier verified artifact.

72
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:30,920
Like a birth certificate.

73
00:04:31,140 --> 00:04:32,320
It's a perfect way to look at it.

74
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:43,760
It proves the file was born in the right hospital, but it tells you absolutely nothing about whether the semantic meaning, the actual truth of the words on the page, survived whatever transformation happened between there and here.

