91
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:31,960
Oh, well.

92
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:35,720
The cryptographic signature behaves exactly the same way.

93
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,040
Right.

94
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:39,320
The watermark perfectly traces back to the master baker.

95
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:46,020
The provenance tool lights up green and says, verified, this originated from the master baker.

96
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:49,780
It tells us we're still in the exact same digital kitchen.

97
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:51,400
