98
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,360
Exactly.

99
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:57,940
The watermark survived perfectly fine, but the edible truth of the recipe was completely destroyed.

100
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:05,740
And that, right there, is the exact vulnerability we face when we let AI systems transform verified documents.

101
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:09,920
Because the AI doesn't know what sugar or salt is, conceptually.

102
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:11,720
No, it's just predicting tokens.

103
