You might have a heavily vetted, peer-reviewed financial report.

104
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:20,640
You feed it into a large language model and say, hey, summarize this for a non-technical audience.

105
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,460
Which people do literally every single day.

106
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:23,300
Constantly.

107
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:28,220
And the software environment might preserve the cryptographic watermark.

108
